      "mergedPostDetails": "A LOT OF strings are missing in the Group menu page.\n\nThis includes:\n\nThe \"Group Activity\" title for the \"Group Activity\" tab page, even though they are identical.\n\n \n\nThe \"Filter Group Locations\" tooltip for filter.\n\nThe \"Represent Group\" and \"Stop Representing\" tabs on the upper-right corner. And also their \"You are now representing {0} on your nameplate and profile\" and \"You are no longer representing {0} on your nemplate and profile\" notifications.\n\nAll the (upper) tabs in a group:\n\n\"Announcements\", \"Instance\", \"Gallery\", and \"Group Info\". Their tooltips are avaliable.\n\nAll strings that shows when the tab is empty (no [content] avaliable): \"No announcements available for {0}\", \"No instances available for {0}\", \"No gallery available for {0}\".\n\nUnder the \"Instace\" tab page, the sorting method(s): \"Total members\", and possibly more.\n\nUnder the \"Announcements\" tab page, the \"Group\" and possibly more announcement status (or maybe visibility) and the \"at\" in the announcement time.\n\nUnder the \"Gallery\" tab page, the defaul list name maybe included, this includes \"Banner and Icon\" and possibly more.\n\nUnder the \"Group Info' tab page, missing strings include:\n\nThe \"Join This Group\" button;\n\nThe \"Public\", \"Private\"*, etc. status;\n\nThe \"About This Group\" and \"Group Rules\" sections titles.\n\nUnder the \"Setting\" page, this includs:\n\nThe \"Member\", \"Moderator\"*, etc. roles;\n\nThe \"Subscribe To Announcements\" and \"Unsubscribe From Announcements\" toggle button;\n\nAnd the representation toggle button again.\n\nUnder the \"Report [Group]\" window, this include:\n\nThe \"Where is the issue? Select all that apply\", even though we have and identical entry: 25129;\n\nThe \"Behaviour\", \"Image Gallery / Banner / Icon\", \"Name\", \"Description\" options, even though they all have identical entries in Crowdin;\n\nThe \"NEXT\" button. The tooltips are avaliable.\n\nThis entire issue also applies for the following page(s). I won't repeat them string by string for them, as they are all in similar situation.\n\nUnder the \"Group Rules\" window opend upon clicking \"Join Group\", this include:\n\nThe \"Group Rules\" title;\n\nThe \"The group owner has not set any rules\" content;\n\nand the \"Join\" button.\n\nUnder the \"Welcome!\" window after just joining a group, this includes:\n\nThe \"Welcome!\" title;\n\nThe \"Now that you're a member of this group you can join group instances, see the group gallery and rep the group on your nameplate\" and \"Some options may depend on your group roles and permissions\" content;\n\nThe \"Close\" button.\n\nI will add more missing strings into this post as I discover them. If there are a lot of strings missing in another section of the Group page (such as menaging a group), I may create a new post.\n\nThanks StormRel :D",
